---
<Guest title="Checkout">
  <p>Thank you for staying with us. Please follow these simple steps before departure.</p>

  <div class="g-callout">
    <p><strong>Check-out time: 11:00 AM</strong></p>
  </div>

  <h2>Essential Tasks</h2>

  <h3>Kitchen</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Run the dishwasher (or wash and put away dishes)</li>
    <li>Wipe down countertops</li>
    <li>Take out kitchen trash</li>
    <li>Leave used dish towels on the counter</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Throughout the House</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Take out all trash to the designated bins</li>
    <li>Place used towels in the bathroom</li>
    <li>Strip beds and leave linens in a pile on each bed</li>
    <li>Close and lock all windows</li>
    <li>Turn off all lights</li>
    <!-- PLACEHOLDER --><li>Adjust thermostat to 60°F</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Outdoor</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Turn off the BBQ and ensure it's cool</li>
    <li>Put cushions in storage (if weather requires)</li>
    <li>Dispose of any outdoor trash</li>
    <li>Close and lock the spa cover</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Before You Leave</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Check all rooms for personal belongings</li>
    <!-- PLACEHOLDER --><li>Return keys to front porch lockbox · code provided in booking email</li>
    <li>Lock all doors and windows</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What You Don't Need to Do</h2>
  <p>Our cleaning service handles all of this:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Deep clean the house</li>
    <li>Vacuum or mop floors</li>
    <li>Clean bathrooms (just tidy up)</li>
    <li>Wash bed linens or towels</li>
    <li>Clean inside appliances</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Thermostat by Season</h2>

  <h3>Summer (May – September)</h3>
  <p>Set to 72°F before leaving.</p>

  <h3>Winter (October – April)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Set to 60°F before leaving</li>
    <li><strong>Never below 55°F</strong> (prevents pipe freezing)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Appliances</h2>

  <h3>Turn Off</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>All stove burners</li>
    <li>Oven</li>
    <li>Coffee maker</li>
    <li>Outdoor grill</li>
    <li>Fireplace</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Leave On</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Refrigerator</li>
    <li>Thermostat (at the appropriate temperature)</li>
    <li>WiFi router</li>
    <li>All smart home devices</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Final Walkthrough</h2>
  <p>Before you lock up, take 5 minutes:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> linens stripped, windows closed, lights off</li>
    <li><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> towels left as instructed, toilets flushed, lights off</li>
    <li><strong>Kitchen:</strong> dishwasher running, trash out, counters wiped, lights off</li>
    <li><strong>Living areas:</strong> windows closed, fireplace off, lights off</li>
    <li><strong>Outdoor:</strong> spa covered, grill off, furniture tidy</li>
    <li><strong>Entryway:</strong> all doors locked</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Lost & Found</h2>
  <p>If you realize you left something behind, contact the property manager immediately (see <a href="/guest/contacts">Contacts</a>). We'll search and arrange return shipping if found.</p>

  <h2>Early or Late Checkout</h2>
  <p><strong>Early:</strong> feel free to leave early — please still complete the tasks above.<br/>
  <strong>Late:</strong> must be pre-approved (additional fees may apply). Contact the property manager at least 24 hours in advance.</p>
</Guest>
